  "purpose": "(Clinical Focus: All active ingredients in RxNorm used in clinical drugs, identifying either a \"generic\" or \"brand-specific\" ingredient concept. Intended to represent ingredient substances that may function as reactants.),(Data Element Scope: Medication reactant substance, Administrable drug),(Inclusion Criteria: \"Value set intensionally defined from RXNORM (OID: 2.16.840.1.113883.6.88)\nUnion(\n   FilterOnProperty(TTY,IN),\n   FilterOnProperty(TTY,PIN), \n   FilterOnProperty(TTY, MIN),\n   FilterOnProperty(TTY,BN),\n )\"),(Exclusion Criteria: Concepts not in the inclusion criteria.)",
  "compose": {
    "include": [ {
      "system": "http://www.nlm.nih.gov/research/umls/rxnorm",
      "version": "09022025",
